(6. FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
54 730 Td
(The system shall allow administrators to manage student records and billing information.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
54 712 Td
(The system shall allow administrators to add fees, school terms, and billing policies.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
54 694 Td
(The system shall generate student bills and itemized invoices with details of charges and payment status.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
54 676 Td
(The system shall record student payments and automatically update balances.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
54 658 Td
(The system shall prevent duplicate billing entries and invalid overpayments.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
54 640 Td
(The system shall provide statement of account reports and payment history for students.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
54 622 Td
(The system shall support secure login and role-based access control.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
54 604 Td
(The system shall allow authorized users to generate financial reports and summaries.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 12 Tf
52 574 Td
(7. NON-FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
54 556 Td
(The system must be reliable, accurate, and easy to use.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
54 538 Td
(The system must protect financial data through secure authentication and access control.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
54 520 Td
(The system must be responsive and compatible with standard web browsers.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
54 502 Td
(The system must be scalable to support future school growth and additional features.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
54 484 Td
(The system must maintain data integrity and minimize errors in transaction processing.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 12 Tf
52 454 Td
(8. USERS OF THE SYSTEM) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
54 436 Td
(Administrator: manages student accounts, billing setup, invoices, and reports.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
54 418 Td
(Student: views billing statements, payment records, and outstanding balances.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
54 400 Td
(School staff or authorized personnel: access billing data based on assigned privileges.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 12 Tf
52 370 Td
(9. BENEFITS OF THE SYSTEM) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
54 352 Td
(Improved efficiency in school fee management.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
54 334 Td
(Reduced manual workload and paperwork.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
54 316 Td
(Accurate and transparent student billing records.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
54 298 Td
(Better payment tracking and monitoring of balances.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
54 280 Td
(Faster generation of invoices and reports.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
54 262 Td
(Enhanced confidence in financial decision-making.) Tj
ET
